an do.<br />\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Ann</span>: Can you tell me where baggage carousel 8 is?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Attendant</span>: Sure. It's across the hall, on your left.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "baggage carousel ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the place in an airport where your luggage arrives", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My suitcase is not on the baggage carousel!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear in an airport when you collect your luggage.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "oversized", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an item that is too big", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My bag is bigger than a regular suitcase, so it could be at the oversized luggage carousel.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fragile", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an object that can be easily broken or damaged", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Did you pack any fragile items in your bag?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "handler ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who takes luggage from a plane to the baggage carousel", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Boston Airport luggage handlers are the best in the country!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "breakable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an object that can be easily broken; fragile", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I hope you have nothing breakable in your bag!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "carry-on", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a piece of luggage you do not have to check in at the airport ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I packed all the breakable items in my carry-on.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "conveyor belt", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the moving band of the luggage carousel", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is no luggage left on the conveyor belt.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Comparative and Superlative Adjectives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use a comparative to compare somebody or something to <span class =\"strong\">one</span> other person or thing.<br /> You use a superlative to compare somebody or something to the whole <span class =\"strong\">group</span> that he, she or it belongs to.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ul>  \t<li>you use <span class =\"strong\">than</span> after comparatives </li> \t<li>you add <span class =\"strong\">the</span> in front of the superlative form to describe people, places and things</li> </ul>  <br> Look at the chart for information on how to form comparatives and superlatives:\t\t\t", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Comparative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Superlative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" small\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" smaller (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the smallest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"big\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bigger (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the biggest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"safe\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"safer (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the safest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"careful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more careful (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the most careful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"good<br />bad\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"better (than)<br /> worse (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the best<br />the worst\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"far\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"farther (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the farthest\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Attendant</span>: Is it your bag?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Ann</span>: No, it isn't. My bag is smaller than this one.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write a short paragraph (8-10 lines) about a typical day in the life of a luggage handler. Write about what the job requires.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go online and make a list of oversized or fragile items that the handler must carry carefully.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use comparative adjectives.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph to your partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write about travel and transportation job.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about the workplace and the person's job.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use comparative adjectives to describe two objects.", "type": "text"}]}]}